From: slaier <slaier@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 22:36:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(tts-server): add mp3 response format using lame

Adds support for the "mp3" response format in `tts-server` via `libmp3lame`.
Includes a new header `audio-mp3.h` for encoding mono float32 PCM to MP3
with VBR and a Xing header, updates CMake configuration, and documents
the new API option in the README.
